# Allow-list: only code and docs are tracked. Data (GTEx expression, genotypes, proportions, results), logs and
# figures never leave the cluster. Ignore everything, then allow the code/doc file types in the top folder only.
*
!.gitignore
!*.R
!*.sh
!*.sbatch
!*.cpp
!*.py
!*.md
# never: outputs, logs, old versions, plots, credentials
output/
logs/
superseded/
private/
Rplots.pdf
*.rds
*.csv
*.tsv
*.gz
*.json
